"view.agepointresults.help"        = "The content of this screen depends on the choice you made in the input screen.\n\nIf you chose 'Position for Event', you see three tabs. The 'Positions' tab shows the exact Age Point position. The 'Matches' tab shows aspects and midpoints to the radix. The asterisk '*' represents the Age Point position. The 'Wheel' tab shows the horoscope with the Age Point position indicated by an arrow.\n\nIf you chose 'Overview', you see two tabs. The 'Positions' tab lists the Age Point position for each year from 0 to 71. Ages 0–48 also show the matching second-cycle age (e.g. 0/72, 1/73 … 48/120). The 'Wheel' tab shows the horoscope with year marks in the outer ring.\n\nFor both horoscope charts, the icons at the top let you switch between colour and black/white, show or hide aspects, and export the chart to PNG.";
